@startuml st-reservation
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6

title State Machine Diagram — Reservation Entity (6 States)

[*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT : Customer selects unit type & submits booking\n[Capacity reserved in 30-day window]\n/ ReservationService#createReservation (BR-RES-01)

PENDING_PAYMENT --> CONFIRMED : Customer completes VNPay payment within 48 hours\n[PaymentTransaction SUCCESS]\n/ PaymentService#completeVnpayPayment (BR-PAY-02, BR-DEP-03)
PENDING_PAYMENT --> EXPIRED : 48 hours pass without payment\n/ ReservationExpiryScheduler (BR-RES-02)
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : Customer manually cancels reservation draft\n/ ReservationService#cancelPendingReservation

CONFIRMED --> FULFILLED : Unit allocated, contract activated & checked in\n/ HandoverService#completeCheckIn (BR-CHK-03)
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : Customer cancels confirmed reservation\n[Deposit refund according to cancellation schedule]\n/ ReservationService#cancelConfirmedReservation (BR-CAN-01)
CONFIRMED --> NO_SHOW : Customer never shows up past auto-activation deadline\n/ AutoActivationScheduler (BR-CAN-04)

EXPIRED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
FULFILLED --> [*]
NO_SHOW --> [*]
@enduml

